{"data":{"id":"tk2onZoeOrI","slug":"shokazulu","title":"Shokazulu","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"RKPDnvGtojQ","slug":"dis-yah-one-i-love","title":"Dis Yah One I Love"},{"id":"9IfvdHNx4jY","slug":"part-4","title":"Part 4"},{"id":"Oqlyga2WyTw","slug":"dis-yah-one-i-love-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Dis Yah One I Love (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"AoomI066mmg","position":14,"timestamp":"00:15:43","rawTrack":"Shokazulu - Dis Yah One I Love","track":{"id":"RKPDnvGtojQ","path":"/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love/","slug":"dis-yah-one-i-love","title":"Dis Yah One I Love","artist":{"slug":"shokazulu","title":"Shokazulu"},"artwork":"images/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2rGGkxAhObM","slug":"346.5","tags":[6,3,6],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/soulection-live-at-the-el-rey-explicit/ra.1350142144","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-tour-live-at-the-el-rey-explicit?in=soulection/sets/soulection-radio-sessions"},"state":"published","title":"Live at the El Ray","artwork":"/images/episodes/346-5.jpg","content":"For the first time ever, Beats 1 is Live from a Soulection show.\n\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":9282,"location":"US","published_at":"2018-02-15T10:28:53+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"QHlnoMI5wns","position":77,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Shokazulu - Dis Yah One I Love","track":{"id":"RKPDnvGtojQ","path":"/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love/","slug":"dis-yah-one-i-love","title":"Dis Yah One I Love","artist":{"slug":"shokazulu","title":"Shokazulu"},"artwork":"images/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uvJZqSGqvgU","slug":"boilerroom-streaming-from-isolation-14","tags":[6,3],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joekay/jboiler-room-streaming-from-isolation-14"},"state":"published","title":"Boilerroom - Joe Kay 4 hour Streaming from Isolation #14","artwork":null,"content":"Joe Kay appears on BoilerRoom Live Streaming from Isolation sessions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\n[Please support here if you can.](https://business.facebook.com/donate/219168332618496/)\n\nDuring the pandemic, tune into our new live series Streaming From Isolation. These broadcasts will stream from artists’ homes and private spaces, direct to our audience and without the need for interaction with production teams - as we practice social distancing to remove risk from our programming.\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-04-10T20:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's 4 hour experiance","position":0}},{"id":"_tvR97XM0U4","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Shokazulu - Dis Yah One I Love","track":{"id":"RKPDnvGtojQ","path":"/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love/","slug":"dis-yah-one-i-love","title":"Dis Yah One I Love","artist":{"slug":"shokazulu","title":"Shokazulu"},"artwork":"images/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"vhoqhoBeD_A","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Shokazulu - Dis Yah One I Love (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"Oqlyga2WyTw","path":"/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"dis-yah-one-i-love-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Dis Yah One I Love (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"shokazulu","title":"Shokazulu"},"artwork":"images/artists/shokazulu/tracks/dis-yah-one-i-love-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-172-w-rhettmatic-beat-junkies"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10880,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"i